    "只用 ⌥ 时只能配 F 键或空格，请再加 ⌘ 或 ⌃" : {
      "comment" : "Shortcut recorder: rejected key",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
